# decision errors-one-rule (user): an Error raises unless it reaches an optional place or a handler
'r = write("no such folder/x.txt", "hi"); 1'	error	a failed write put in a plain variable stops the run
'f(p) := write(p, "hi"); r = f("no such folder/x.txt"); 2'	error	an Error a program's own word gives back too
'r: json? = parse_json("{oops"); r failed'	true
'parse_json("{oops") or 7'	7
'0 or 10'	10
